Feature: Mask invoice_number in d_product_revenue_clone table

  Background:
    Given the schema for the d_product_revenue table includes invoice_number as a string

  Scenario Outline: Mask invoice_number for valid cases
    Given the invoice_number is "<invoice_number>"
    When the masking logic is applied
    Then the masked invoice_number should be "<expected_masked_number>"
    
    Examples:
      | invoice_number | expected_masked_number |
      | 1234234534     | 123423****             |
      | 5678901234     | 567890****             |
      | 8910111213     | 891011****             |

  Scenario Outline: Handle short invoice_numbers
    Given the invoice_number is "<invoice_number>"
    When checking the length of the invoice_number
    Then the invoice_number should be unchanged "<expected_output>"
    
    Examples:
      | invoice_number | expected_output |
      | 123            | 123             |
      | 45             | 45              |
      | null           | null            |

  Scenario Outline: Handle alphanumeric invoice_numbers
    Given the invoice_number is "<invoice_number>"
    When applying masking to alphanumeric invoice_number
    Then the masked invoice_number should be "<expected_masked_number>"
    
    Examples:
      | invoice_number | expected_masked_number |
      | ABC1234567     | ABC123****             |
      | ZYX0987654     | ZYX098****             |

  Scenario: Drop existing d_product_revenue_clone table
    Given the d_product_revenue_clone table exists in the schema
    When the table is dropped if it exists
    Then there should be no d_product_revenue_clone table present

  Scenario: Clone and apply masking
    Given the d_product_revenue table exists
    When a replica is created as d_product_revenue_clone
    Then the invoice_number column should be masked with the last 4 digits replaced by '*'

  Scenario: Validate error condition for schema mismatch
    Given the schema for d_product_revenue and d_product_revenue_clone are provided
    When checking the schema consistency
    Then an error message should display "Schema mismatch detected." if inconsistent

  Scenario: Save clone table in specified format
    Given the required storage format for d_product_revenue_clone is Delta
    When the data is written to disk
    Then the d_product_revenue_clone table should be saved in Delta format

  Scenario: Error handling for unsupported data types
    Given the invoice_number contains non-string values
    When attempting to apply masking
    Then an error message "Unsupported invoice number format." should be returned
